  "what has he shipped on azure?": {
    "answer": "He has shipped a document intelligence assistant on Azure for Sikich, an enterprise consulting firm, owned from ingestion through deployment. He built a LangGraph agent exposing 14 tools for document question answering, cross-document comparison, and template-driven generation, grounded by hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval with Cohere re-ranking, guarded by PII and entity redaction, and scored for hallucination rate by LLM-as-a-Judge evaluations. He also built a header-aware chunking, Markdown-header splitting plus recursive splitting, with SHA-256 deduplication and Azure Blob Storage metadata, and provided streaming FastAPI endpoints over Server-Sent Events with a React single-page app.",
